# Personal job search tracking
job_search_tracker.csv
job_postings/

# Upskill reports (personal output)
upskill/*.md

# Career ROI reports (personal output)
career-roi/*.md

# Claude Code local machine/session state (paths, permission history — never share)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

